264
00:19:22,640 --> 00:19:27,640
What did I tell you? I'm sure your sealing magic can come in handy in ways that you haven't even discovered.

265
00:19:28,640 --> 00:19:31,640
It doesn't matter who you are. There are some things that only you can do.

266
00:19:32,640 --> 00:19:34,640
Things that only I can do?

267
00:19:35,640 --> 00:19:42,640
That's why we're inventing these magic items. If every person used their talents to help everyone else, the world would be great.

268
00:19:42,640 --> 00:19:46,640
The only way you know how to live is by taking from other people.

269
00:19:47,640 --> 00:19:52,640
But now, the ones you hurt, stepped on, and brought to shame are going to take it all back!

270
00:19:53,640 --> 00:19:56,640
Well, I suggest you get started with that then.

271
00:19:57,640 --> 00:20:01,640
Regardless of what you do to combat this magic, it won't stop flowing until you've defeated me.

272
00:20:01,640 --> 00:20:10,640
The exit is here on the top floor, so the more time you waste running your mouth, the more likely it is that your friends in the other rooms will get swallowed up!

273
00:20:12,640 --> 00:20:13,640
This is bad!

274
00:20:13,640 --> 00:20:19,640
If not even Licht and Lumiere had the power to stop him, then is there anything the rest of us can do?

275
00:20:22,640 --> 00:20:23,640
Very well.

276
00:20:24,640 --> 00:20:29,640
My friends and I are going to rid this fortress of your evil magic with a spell that combines all our might.

277
00:20:30,640 --> 00:20:31,640
Careful, Licht!

278
00:20:32,640 --> 00:20:34,640
I need to borrow your power.

279
00:20:34,640 --> 00:20:45,640
Crap. I probably should have thought this idea through a little more.

280
00:20:46,640 --> 00:20:49,640
Yes, you should have, human. Can't you make this space any wider?

281
00:20:50,640 --> 00:20:53,640
Did you seriously ask me that? This is the thanks to get for saving your ass?

282
00:20:54,640 --> 00:20:56,640
You sure you're possessed because you sound like the real Charlotte?

283
00:20:56,640 --> 00:21:02,640
Damn, this nasty stuff is going to chip away at my magic until it's gone.

284
00:21:03,640 --> 00:21:07,640
If you didn't know how to use recovery magic, we'd really be up a creek right now, wouldn't we?

285
00:21:08,640 --> 00:21:10,640
Hmph, you're welcome, brute.

286
00:21:11,640 --> 00:21:16,640
Hey, uh, what's the deal? Why are you glowing? Is that, uh, normal for elves?

287
00:21:17,640 --> 00:21:18,640
It's this...

288
00:21:21,640 --> 00:21:24,640
That's what you get for wasting my precious food!

289
00:21:24,640 --> 00:21:27,640
Behold! Behold the power of hunger!

290
00:21:39,640 --> 00:21:41,640
It's him, Licht.

291
00:21:46,640 --> 00:21:48,640
At last, we elves get our vengeance.

292
00:21:49,640 --> 00:21:52,640
Ultimate sword magic. Demon dweller sword conquering Eon!

293
00:21:52,640 --> 00:21:53,640
Burning Eon!

294
00:21:53,640 --> 00:21:54,640
No way!

295
00:21:54,640 --> 00:21:55,640
No way!

296
00:21:55,640 --> 00:21:56,640
No way!

297
00:21:56,640 --> 00:21:58,640
No way!

298
00:21:58,640 --> 00:21:59,640
No way!

299
00:21:59,640 --> 00:22:00,640
No way!

300
00:22:00,640 --> 00:22:01,640
No way!

301
00:22:01,640 --> 00:22:03,640
No way!

302
00:22:03,640 --> 00:22:20,640
No way!

303
00:22:20,640 --> 00:22:23,640
His magic's unbelievable.

304
00:22:23,640 --> 00:22:26,640
It's over.

305
00:22:26,640 --> 00:22:29,640
He's dead. Well done.

306
00:22:33,640 --> 00:22:42,640
Is that... the devil's heart?

307
00:22:42,640 --> 00:22:48,640
Heal me.

308
00:22:48,640 --> 00:22:52,640
Weren't you listening?

309
00:22:52,640 --> 00:22:55,640
I told you it would be impossible to kill me!

310
00:22:55,640 --> 00:23:00,640
Using magic from this world anyway.

311
00:23:00,640 --> 00:23:05,640
After everything they threw at him, he's still regenerated? Now what?

312
00:23:05,640 --> 00:23:10,640
That sword is even more deadly than I thought it was.

313
00:23:10,640 --> 00:23:15,640
If my own sword has a power I haven't unlocked yet, then we still have a chance.

314
00:23:15,640 --> 00:23:18,640
I couldn't erase that spear, but I did block it.

315
00:23:18,640 --> 00:23:22,640
That probably means my anti-magic was too weak to break through.

316
00:23:22,640 --> 00:23:25,640
But if it kinda worked, then it's possible, right?

317
00:23:25,640 --> 00:23:35,640
So, if I can fight as hard as them, then there's something only I can do because I don't have any magic!

318
00:23:35,640 --> 00:23:40,640
I may not have mana, but that's why I'm the one person who can pull this off!

319
00:23:40,640 --> 00:23:42,640
Get ready, cause I'm not done yet!

320
00:23:42,640 --> 00:23:46,640
Black Clover, page 119, the final attack!

321
00:23:46,640 --> 00:23:49,640
You know, let's shut this guy up together!

